      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mwasanga umuntu yishwe, arambaraye mu gahinga, muri mu gihugu Uhoraho Imana yanyu yabahaye ngo mucegukire, uwamwishe ntamenyekane; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abakuru n’abacamanza bo muri mwebge baze bagende, bahēre ah’ uwo muvyimba uri, batambuke intambge bashike ku bisagara biri hafi y’ah’ uwo muntu yiciwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.19.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 19:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maz’ igisagara kizorusha ibindi kuba hafi yaho, abakuru bo mur’ ico gisagara baze bazane inka y’ishashi bakūye mu busho, itigeze gukoreshwa igikorwa, canke ngw isangire ingōgo n’iyindi, zikwega ikintu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bayimanukane mu mwonga ahar’ amazi atemba, hatagira indimiro cank’ imbibe, bayivunire izosi aho nyene mur’ uyo mwonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 10:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abaherezi bo mu ruvyaro rwa Lewi bīgire hafi, kukw abo ari bo Uhoraho Imana yanyu yatoranije ngo bamuhereze, ngo bahezagire n’abantu mw izina ryiwe, kandi ni bo basanzwe baca imanza zose z’imiburano n’iz’ inguma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.26.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 26:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.73.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "73:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.27.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 27:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuru bose bo mu gisagara kirusha ibindi kuba hafi y’ah’ uwo muntu yiciwe, baze bakarabire kur’ iyo nka yavuniwe izosi mur’ uwo mwonga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.3.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 3:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bavuge, bat’ Amaboko yacu si yo yavishije ayo maraso, kandi n’ amaso yacu ntiyabibonye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.26.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 26:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JON.1.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yon 1:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bat’ Uhoraho, harira abantu bawe Abisirayeli, abo wacunguye, kandi ntubahōre amaraso y’uwazize ubusa. Uko ni ko bazoharirwa ayo maraso, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.19.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 19:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ni ko muzokūra amaraso y’uwazize ubusa hagati muri mwebge, ni mwakora ivyo Uhoraho abona kw ari vyiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mwagenda gutera abansi banyu, Uhoraho Imana yanyu akabagabura mu maboko yanyu, mukabajana ar’ inyagano; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni hagira ūbona mu banyagano umwigeme mwiza cank’ umugore, akamugomwa, akagomba kumwābīra; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "az’ amujane i we, yimoshe, ace inzāra, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akūre impuzu yanyaganywe, agume mu rugo rwiwe, amare ukwezi kwose agandariye se na nyina; hanyuma abone kumwābīra, babane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.24.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 24:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma ni yabona atakimuhimbaye, az’ amureke agende iy’ agomba; ariko ntaz’ amugure amahera, canke ngw amucuranguze ukw agomba, kukw azoba yamaze kumwonona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
