              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "49:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw akwiye kwerekana umwana w’ intabga kw ari we mfura, avyerekanishe kumuha imigabane ibiri y’ivy’ atunze vyose: kukw ari we buzibūra bgiwe; ibigerewe imfura n’ivyiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
